# H2 database files and uploaded photos — both regenerate, neither belongs in git.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash. Without one these match a directory of that
# name at ANY depth, and `storage/` was quietly excluding
# src/main/java/.../integration/storage/ — FileStorage and PlaceholderImages
# were never committed, so a fresh clone of this branch did not compile.
/data/
/storage/
# Local smoke-test profile writes here.
/storage-local/
